{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05848","headline":"林园即事寄舍弟紞 · 王维","name":"林园即事寄舍弟紞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寓目一萧散，销忧冀俄顷。\n青草肃澄陂，白云移翠岭。\n後沔通河渭，前山包鄢郢。\n松含风里声，花对池中影。\n地多齐后㿉，人带荆州瘿。\n徒思赤笔书，讵有丹砂井。\n心悲常欲绝，髪乱不能整。\n青簟日何长，闲门昼方静。\n颓思茅檐下，弥伤好风景。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}